  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Integrated Peace building, Psychosocial Support and Livelihoods Restoration for Conflict&#x2011;Affected Communities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed project seeks to enhance community resilience, social cohesion, and safety in the East Meskan and Mareko special woredas by implementing an integrated framework of Mental Health and Psychosocial Support (MHPSS), transitional justice, conflict prevention, and livelihood restoration to mitigate protection risks and drivers of irregular migration.</narrative>
  </description>
